[Quotes]
victory0 = "You wanted to see me at my strongest? Just get me all riled up and I'll set you on fire!"
victory1 = "How'd ya like my Kiai Dan technique in action?! It's my best move! HA!"
victory2 = "Heh... You've got a good right hook there!"
victory3 = "I don't know anything about what it takes to be a hero, but since when has losing helped bring justice to the world?"
victory4 = "I'm not worried about any challengers when I've got you around! Let's do this, (Partner)!"
victory5 = "Keep on bringing it if you need to take your frustration out on something. I don't mind pounding on you until you get a clue."
victory6 = "There's only one rule to fighting: the strong will win."
victory7 = "Whoa! Not bad! I really felt that last one!"
victory8 = "You'll never be able to hold on to your principles if you're weak. If you don't like that, then get stronger and do something about it."
